# Line endings: every text file is stored and checked out with LF, on every OS.
# A Windows checkout otherwise converts files to CRLF and a 5-line change shows as a whole-file
# rewrite (#143, round 2). Binary files are detected automatically; the list below makes the
# common ones explicit so they are never touched.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
*.zip  binary
